        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "从一比五到六比五，高芙连赢五局，反而拿到赛点。正反手的拉锯战里，她却没能收下这次机会。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "56e1734fae05efab7904c51a7c12e280ba619a0db291298befae6c2ac2dfefe5",
      "words_sha256": "5d6b0bcd9e1ece37cae0ac21d80f3d1b5a4827b2adc68887f50871803816e550"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:5e202f2e97e5fc065f726ee358c3d59b1a7353da358bd0aeff4e1a41423db19d",
      "request_id": "5e202f2e97e5fc065f726ee358c3d59b1a7353da358bd0aeff4e1a41423db19d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0e1fbbcc5fc12d3aa58ef167d7e211e8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这一次，她弯下腰，吼了出来。错过的赛点留在上一盘，她把胜利带到了终点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "4718ea088a50719a3147bf5e8fd58931ae10cbf5d054c1353d0bd1b832be11df",
      "words_sha256": "5be1d1edd428365610a224925329ce82f5013866c40a196c783c596e3a7d0889"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:62e836d5939d314b9cb86715567af4722859b8994956aeceb90d3d09111bce03",
      "request_id": "62e836d5939d314b9cb86715567af4722859b8994956aeceb90d3d09111bce03",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5278cfdf155386e6b6373e34bf4289a1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "只差一分就能赢，转眼却要再打一盘。北京时间十一月九日清晨，年终总决赛印第安韦尔斯小组赛。高芙怎么赢回这场球？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b8e0604aebea8f96cd040b847b23953ce3f9eadb17c9167be06473f98c215f22",
      "words_sha256": "e7048a7cd57bc6f93b5baa0e3cfb92ed334d8ae53ade3247d520248584ea22b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6bfdd46f888191b09d3733909e4409e8ef90c67d446c2710b07418bb2debafc9",
      "request_id": "6bfdd46f888191b09d3733909e4409e8ef90c67d446c2710b07418bb2debafc9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bf3c7a422595d8dbbf89042cfe3b3bb4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "抢七，五比七。追回来的这一盘还是丢了。可决胜盘，高芙先拿三比零。该盘非受迫失误，她六次，佩古拉二十三次。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f7f071d7bb7b3e490c4409a2d136b379125784c5ec840dc1e24b065e4083c712",
      "words_sha256": "505c55c21432345df1cfcb6e4e00a9a1064a9c3bdbea7dcf33910fe4b25e031a"
    },
    {
